$errors=@('The first publisher script, `evidence/tools/publish-attempt-06.ps1`, did not execute because PowerShell parsed `$id:` in an interpolated error string as an invalid scoped variable reference. No files were copied or manifests changed by that failed invocation.','','The resumed publisher script, `evidence/tools/publish-attempt-06-resumed.ps1`, copied five GLBs, updated `app/public/asset-manifest.json` and the R1 delivery manifest, and wrote `evidence/continuation-record-attempt-06.json`. It then returned an error while formatting its final console summary: `The regular expression pattern \\ is not valid.` The failure was in the output-only path-format expression after the mutations. Read-only verification in `publication-verification-attempt-06.json` records the post-write hashes. All changed files passed follow-up hash checks.') -join [Environment]::NewLine
